    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
    "body": "Is there a config parameter that let `mini.comment` comment c++ code with `//...` instead of `/*...*/`",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Is there a config parameter that let <code class=\"notranslate\">mini.comment</code> comment c++ code with <code class=\"notranslate\">//...</code> instead of <code class=\"notranslate\">/*...*/</code></p>",
    "bodyText": "Is there a config parameter that let mini.comment comment c++ code with //... instead of /*...*/",
    "category": {
        "createdAt": "2022-01-02T14:24:09Z",
        "description": "Ask the community for help",
