                {
                    "author": {
                        "avatarUrl": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24854248?u=d09fd974c6720eba3039db6beb2f1c1efecdb51d&v=4",
                        "login": "echasnovski",
                        "resourcePath": "/echasnovski",
                        "url": "https://github.com/echasnovski"
                    },
                    "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
                    "body": "The '~/.config/nvim/after/ftplugin/cpp.lua' (*no* 'lua' subdirectory). Files inside 'ftplugin' directory (either directly or inside 'after' directory) are considered to have \"filetype plugins\" - files which are sourced when 'filetype' option is set to the value same as file's name.\r\nYou can read more about plugin structure typing `:h 'runtime'` (followed by `<CR>`, a.k.a. `<Enter>`).",
                    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">The '~/.config/nvim/after/ftplugin/cpp.lua' (<em>no</em> 'lua' subdirectory). Files inside 'ftplugin' directory (either directly or inside 'after' directory) are considered to have \"filetype plugins\" - files which are sourced when 'filetype' option is set to the value same as file's name.<br>\nYou can read more about plugin structure typing <code class=\"notranslate\">:h 'runtime'</code> (followed by <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;CR&gt;</code>, a.k.a. <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;Enter&gt;</code>).</p>",
                    "bodyText": "The '~/.config/nvim/after/ftplugin/cpp.lua' (no 'lua' subdirectory). Files inside 'ftplugin' directory (either directly or inside 'after' directory) are considered to have \"filetype plugins\" - files which are sourced when 'filetype' option is set to the value same as file's name.\nYou can read more about plugin structure typing :h 'runtime' (followed by <CR>, a.k.a. <Enter>).",
